      <li>
      Copy the following MCO sample profile into a YAML file:
      <CodeBlock code={"apiVersion: machineconfiguration.openshift.io/v1\nkind: MachineConfig\nmetadata:\n   labels:\n     machineconfiguration.openshift.io/role: worker0\n   name: 99-worker0-devices\nspec:\n   config:\n     ignition:\n       version: 3.2.0\n     storage:\n       files:\n       - contents:\n           source: <base64_data_uri>\n         filesystem: root\n         mode: 420\n         path: /etc/udev/rules.d/41-dasd-eckd-0.0.4444.rules"} lang="yaml" />
      <p>where:</p>
